+//
+// Same cause as src/utils.js: jose 6 is ESM-only and a Vercel function's
+// CommonJS loader cannot require() it, which made merely importing this file
+// abort server startup. Unlike utils.js, jose is used synchronously here inside
+// a passport callback, so it cannot be awaited at the call site.
+//
+// The require is therefore attempted first — correct and synchronous wherever
+// it works, which is every normal Node process — and only falls back to filling
